0..73 Comment "// One part of a quasi-inverse or an equivalence, taken by a pattern that"
74..150 Comment "// names every field and uses one, or by a label pattern that names one. The"
151..229 Comment "// fields the arm leaves alone are named all the same: the round trips mention"
230..306 Comment "// the maps before them, so a type read inside the arm names the forward map"
307..380 Comment "// the arm never uses — by the variable written for it, or by its label"
381..457 Comment "// where the pattern writes none, primed apart from a variable of that name."
459..500 Comment "// The quasi-inverse and the equivalence."
